# The Next Chapter: the bed. Three saws drifting against each other (unison 3,
# 9 cents) over a sub an octave down, into the ladder low and warm; the filter
# swells open slowly on every chord and a slow LFO keeps it breathing. Drive and
# saturation give the low mids body, so the chords sound full, not thin. No
# effects of its own: the song's buses carry the room.
